UVlOGeiy_UrQaQjtVRX9PJ5NnccovSeEs8ujawrHbhqIyJjVuj7pQK0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEuVK-0H7hTLDK97F2IqPEOFJk-xglBqxXHPzENMcYQhA&oe=6A97403F"}, "display_name": "Cake Or Fake ?", "keywords": ["CAKE", "FAKE", "ISIT", "COOKING", "KITCHEN"], "long_description": "Step into the most hyper-realistic bakery ever built in virtual reality. In Cake or Fake, your mission is simple but mind-bending: create everyday objects that look so real they defy logic, then put them to the ultimate test.\n\nMaster the Art of Deception\nForget standard round cakes. Use our advanced sculpting tools to mold, frost, and paint cakes that look like sneakers, succulent plants, power tools, and more. If it exists in the real world, you can bake it\u2014and fake it.\n\nFeatures That Blur Reality\nUltra-Realistic Physics: Experience a cutting-edge physics engine where batter pours, fondant drapes, and knives slice with satisfying, true-to-life resistance.\n\nStunning Visual Effects (VFX): High-fidelity textures and lighting make your glazes shimmer and your crumbs look good enough to eat.\n\nImmersive Spatial Audio: From the tactile crunch of a hard chocolate shell to the soft poof of powdered sugar, every sound is engineered for total immersion.\n\nThe \"Final Cut\" Moment: Take your creation to the judging table. Watch in high-tension slow motion as the knife descends. Will the judges be fooled, or will your cover be blown?", "short_description": "Cake or Fake? The Ultimate VR Deception Challenge\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/cake-or-fake-vr/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "8 OWL STUDIO", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/cake-or-fake-vr/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics"